        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John DiMaggio, C. H. Greenblatt\n- TV Series: Kim Possible, Teen Titans, The Penguins of Madagascar, Pound Puppies, Samurai Jack, Chowder\n- Characters: Dr. Drakken, Motor Ed, Brother Blood, Aquaman, Rico, Ogre, Niblet, the Scotsman, Shnitzel\n- Companies: Cartoon Network\n\nFacts:\n- John DiMaggio voiced Dr. Drakken and Motor Ed on \"Kim Possible.\"\n- John DiMaggio voiced Brother Blood on \"Teen Titans.\"\n- John DiMaggio voiced Aquaman, Rico on \"The Penguins of Madagascar,\" Ogre, Niblet on \"Pound Puppies,\" the Scotsman on \"Samurai Jack,\" and Shnitzel on \"Chowder.\"\n- C. H. Greenblatt created \"Chowder\" as an American animated television series for Cartoon Network.",
